WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.500
BBC News On-Site: Reporting directly from the ruins of the primary school in Minab.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Classrooms, notebooks, and children's drawings lie scattered beneath heavy concrete debris.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Over 120 children and teachers lost their lives here in a single morning.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Local residents speak of their overwhelming grief and demand international accountability.

